<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="google-site-verification" content="2vgW3_yDK8CCk8ZyLTpuJlg0tERdq7WNOEQkc8jdVUM" />

<title>Ash Rise ― SNS運用代行・営業代行のワンストップ支援</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#150F0C; --ember:#FF4D1C; --ember-2:#FF8A3D; --gold:#FFC24B;
    --paper:#FAF7F2; --paper-2:#F1EAE0; --charcoal:#211812; --ash:#8C8079;
    --line:rgba(33,24,18,.12); --line-dark:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){--paper:#181310;--paper-2:#211a15;--charcoal:#F2ECE3;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.12);}
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{--paper:#181310;--paper-2:#211a15;--charcoal:#F2ECE3;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.12);}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--charcoal);font-family:"Zen Kaku Gothic New","Noto Sans JP",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  section{position:relative;}
  .center{text-align:center;}

  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;border:3px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;}
  .btn:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink);}
  .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));color:#1a0f08;}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25);}
  .btn-white{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-dark{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;}

  header.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;padding:16px 0;transition:background .35s ease, backdrop-filter .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease;}
  header.nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
  header.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(21,15,12,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line-dark);}
  .logo{font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .logo-mark{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, var(--gold), var(--ember) 60%, #8a2200 100%);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(255,120,40,.7);flex:none;}
  nav.links{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#EFE6DC;}
  nav.links a{opacity:.85;text-decoration:none;}
  nav.links a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .nav-cta{padding:10px 18px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink);}
  @media (max-width:1020px){nav.links{display:none;}}

  .hero{min-height:92vh;background:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:140px 0 70px;overflow:hidden;}
  .hero-glow{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(600px 500px at 78% 18%, rgba(255,138,61,.5), transparent 60%),radial-gradient(700px 600px at 15% 85%, rgba(255,77,28,.32), transparent 65%);animation:breathe 9s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none;}
  @keyframes breathe{0%,100%{opacity:.75;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.06);}}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .eyebrow-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,138,61,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,138,61,.4);color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .eyebrow-pill .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);}
  h1.hero-title{color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(30px,4.6vw,52px);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 20px;max-width:760px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  h1.hero-title .hi{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--gold),var(--ember) 55%,var(--ember-2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
  .hero-sub{color:#D9CFC4;font-size:15.5px;max-width:600px;margin:0 0 34px;}
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:44px;}
  .client-strip{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--line-dark);border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:800px;}
  .client-strip span{flex:1;min-width:200px;text-align:center;padding:15px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#D9CFC4;border-right:1px solid var(--line-dark);}
  .client-strip span:last-child{border-right:none;}

  .section-pad{padding:96px 0;}
  .kicker{display:inline-block;color:var(--ember);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;}
  h2.section-title{font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,36px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  p.section-lead{color:var(--ash);font-size:15px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 50px;}

  .problem-box{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 48px;}
  .problem-group h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ember);margin:0 0 18px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ember);}
  .problem-group .check-item{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .problem-group .check-item:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  @media (max-width:700px){.problem-box{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;}}
  .check-item{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;}
  .check-item .ck{flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;margin-top:2px;}
  .wave-cta{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:60px 24px;margin-top:56px;border-radius:28px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,50% 78%,0 100%);}
  .wave-cta p{font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,26px);font-weight:900;margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
  .wave-cta p .hi{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}

  /* Business overview 3 cards */
  .biz-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;}
  .biz-card{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);text-decoration:none;display:block;transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;}
  .biz-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.25);}
  .biz-thumb{height:360px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .biz-thumb svg{width:52px;height:52px;}
  .biz-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
  .biz-thumb::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;}
  .biz-2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6E56CF,#2E2359);}
  .biz-body{padding:20px 22px 24px;}
  .biz-pill{display:inline-block;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .biz-body h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;}
  .biz-body p{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ash);font-size:13px;}
  .biz-body .more{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ember);}
  @media (max-width:860px){.biz-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  /* Business deep-dive block */
  .biz-block{scroll-margin-top:90px;}
  .biz-banner{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .biz-banner .n{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));color:#1a0f08;border-radius:50%;width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;}
  .biz-band{width:100%;padding:22px 20px 40px;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.04em;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 76%,52% 100%,48% 100%,0 76%);background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--ember),var(--gold));margin-bottom:-2px;}
  #biz-sales{--ember:#6E56CF; --ember-2:#9C87E8; --gold:#2E2359;}

  .strength-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .strength-row:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;}
  .strength-num{font-weight:900;font-size:40px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;line-height:1;}
  .strength-row h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:900;}
  .strength-row p{margin:0;color:var(--ash);font-size:13.5px;}
  @media (max-width:600px){.strength-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;}.strength-num{font-size:26px;}}

  .plan-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:36px;}
  .plan-card2{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--paper-2);}
  .plan-head{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:16px;font-weight:900;font-size:14.5px;}
  .plan-list{padding:18px 22px 22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--charcoal);}
  .plan-list div{padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
  .plan-list div:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  @media (max-width:860px){.plan-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  .icon-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:36px;}
  .icon-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--paper-2);padding:22px 18px;text-align:center;}
  .icon-card svg{width:30px;height:30px;margin:0 auto 10px;}
  .icon-card span{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;}
  @media (max-width:700px){.icon-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}

  .funnel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;}
  .funnel-step{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 20px;text-align:center;position:relative;}
  .funnel-step .num{font-weight:900;font-size:13px;color:var(--ember);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .funnel-step h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .funnel-step p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ash);margin:0;}
  .funnel-step:not(:last-child)::after{content:"→";position:absolute;right:-20px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-weight:900;color:var(--ember);font-size:18px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){.funnel{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.funnel-step:not(:last-child)::after{content:"↓";right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-24px;transform:translateX(-50%);}}

  .works-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
  .work-card{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);}
  .work-thumb{height:230px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .work-thumb .play{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);}
  .work-thumb .play::after{content:"";border-style:solid;border-width:8px 0 8px 14px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #fff;margin-left:4px;}
  .work-tag{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;background:#fff;color:var(--charcoal);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;}
  .work-body{padding:18px 20px 22px;}
  .work-body h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:900;}
  .work-body p{margin:0;color:var(--ash);font-size:12.5px;}
  .thumb-1{background:#fff;}
  .thumb-1 img{width:55%;height:55%;object-fit:contain;}
  .thumb-2{background:#fff;}
  .thumb-2 img{width:55%;height:55%;object-fit:contain;}
  .thumb-3{background:#111;overflow:hidden;}
  .thumb-3 .photo{position:absolute;inset:0;background-size:125% auto;background-position:55% 40%;background-repeat:no-repeat;}
  @media (max-width:900px){.works-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  .cta-band{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--ember) 0%, var(--gold) 100%);border-radius:28px;padding:58px 40px;text-align:center;color:#1a0f08;}
  .cta-band h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.4vw,32px);font-weight:900;margin:0 0 14px;}
  .cta-band p{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 30px;color:#3a1c08;}
  .cta-band .btns{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .edge-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
  .edge-card{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px 26px;}
  .edge-num{font-weight:900;font-size:28px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .edge-card h3{font-size:16.5px;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 10px;}
  .edge-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ash);margin:0;}
  @media (max-width:820px){.edge-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .story-box{margin-top:30px;background:var(--ink);color:#EFE6DC;border-radius:20px;padding:32px 34px;}
  .story-box .tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:#1a0f08;font-weight:900;font-size:11.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .story-box p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13.5px;color:#D9CFC4;}
  .story-box p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

  .flow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;}
  .flow-card{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px 16px 20px;text-align:center;clip-path:polygon(0 0,88% 0,100% 50%,88% 100%,0 100%,12% 50%);}
  .flow-card:first-child{clip-path:polygon(0 0,88% 0,100% 50%,88% 100%,0 100%);}
  .step-num{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .flow-card h3{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .flow-card p{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ash);margin:0;}
  @media (max-width:960px){.flow-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.flow-card,.flow-card:first-child{clip-path:none;border-radius:14px;}}

  .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0;cursor:pointer;}
  .faq-q{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;}
  .faq-q .icon{color:var(--ember);font-size:18px;transition:transform .2s;}
  .faq-item.open .icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .25s ease;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ash);}
  .faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:220px;padding-top:12px;}

  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:58px;align-items:start;margin-top:60px;}
  .field{margin-bottom:20px;}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .field input,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-2);font-family:inherit;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--charcoal);resize:vertical;}
  .field input:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:1px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  table.info{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;}
  table.info tr{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  table.info td{padding:14px 0;vertical-align:top;}
  table.info td:first-child{color:var(--ash);width:110px;font-weight:900;}
  .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;}
  .map-frame{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);height:280px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--paper-2),var(--paper));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none;color:var(--charcoal);transition:transform .15s ease;}
  .map-frame:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .map-frame .map-inner{text-align:center;padding:20px;}
  .map-frame svg{width:40px;height:40px;margin:0 auto 12px;}
  .map-frame .addr{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ash);margin:6px 0 14px;line-height:1.6;}
  .map-frame .link-label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-weight:900;font-size:13px;color:var(--ember);}
  @media (max-width:820px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  footer{background:var(--ink);color:#B7ACA1;padding:40px 0;font-size:13px;text-align:center;}
  footer b{color:#fff;}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.hero-glow{animation:none;}html{scroll-behavior:auto;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav" id="siteNav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo"><span class="logo-mark"></span>Ash Rise</div>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#biz-sns">SNS運用代行</a>
      <a href="#biz-sales">営業代行</a>
      <a href="#biz-sns">実績</a>
      <a href="#faq">よくある質問</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary nav-cta">お問い合わせ</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-pill"><span class="dot"></span>広島発のワンストップ支援会社</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">SNS運用も、営業も。<br>止まる理由は、<br>いつも<span class="hi">人手不足</span>。</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">「人材確保」を経営課題の最重要項目に挙げる中規模企業は44.7%。SNSも営業も、やるべきことは分かっていても人手が足りず後回しになっていませんか?</p>
    <p style="color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 34px;">SNS運用代行 × 営業代行で、その人手を補う会社です。</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">お問い合わせ・資料請求 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="kicker">CHECK</span>
    <h2 class="section-title center" style="margin:0 auto 16px;">1つでも当てはまればご相談ください</h2>
    <p class="section-lead center">多くの地域企業が、SNS運用と営業の両方で同じような壁にぶつかっています。</p>
    <div class="problem-box">
      <div class="problem-group">
        <h3>SNS運用について</h3>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>公式アカウントを作りたいが、何から始めればいいか分からない</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>SNSに詳しい担当者が社内にいない</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>投稿はしているが、成果につながっている実感がない</div>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-group">
        <h3>営業について</h3>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>営業の人手が足りず、商談まで手が回らない</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>商談はできても、クロージング(契約獲得)まで至らない</div>
        <div class="check-item"><span class="ck">✓</span>営業ノウハウが属人化していて、社内に蓄積されていない</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wave-cta">
      <p>地域企業の成長を、<span class="hi">最も近くで支えるパートナー</span>に。<br>それがAsh Riseの役割です。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad" style="background:var(--paper-2);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="kicker">BUSINESS</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">事業内容</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">2つの事業を単体でも、組み合わせてもご依頼いただけます。</p>
    <div class="biz-grid">
      <a href="#biz-sns" class="biz-card">
        <div class="biz-thumb biz-1"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="SNS運用代行のイメージ"></div>
        <div class="biz-body"><span class="biz-pill" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--ember));color:#1a0f08;">01 SNS</span><h3>SNS運用代行</h3><p>企画・撮影・編集・投稿・分析までを一貫して支援します。</p><span class="more">詳しく見る ↓</span></div>
      </a>
